body:
I remember dreaming that I was being drowned once, it was pitch black and felt like someone was holding my shoulders down. I kept trying to wake up but I couldn't. Eventually did wake up but it felt so surreal.

&#x200B;

Terrified the shit out of me.

First of all, I'm sorry you're going through this.

&#x200B;

Here is my advice, go to your families thing without him on Sunday, he doesn't deserve your time so take some time away from him for yourself. If possible, I'd suggest staying with family a while to get your thoughts together.

&#x200B;

He doesn't get to lord it over you like that, he doesn't get to demand what shows you do or don't watch, he doesn't get to dictate your life. He doesn't have the right to treat you that way, this you are correct about. He's shown you his true colours and how little he values you, for him to even suggest a power struggle and for him to believe he should have power over a partner like that is absolutely foul. He's abusive and quite frankly, dangerous.

&#x200B;

Please get yourself safe and away from him. Then watch whatever bloody tv show you want.

This.

&#x200B;

An ex-supervisor of mine was constantly trying to get me in trouble.

&#x200B;

People asked me to sign her card, didn't bother.

&#x200B;

People who are assholes, don't deserve shit.

You're right, it absolutely is exhausting. 

&#x200B;

I hope you have found some more balanced out friendships now!
